格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin for controlling mobile devices (ADB/iOS) — DeepSeek Harness 操控手机插件","id":"gh:1333189078","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mobile-control","slug":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mobile-automation","mobile-control"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin for controlling mobile devices (ADB/iOS) — DeepSeek Harness 操控手机插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mobile-control"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> DeepSeek Harness 插件 · 操控手机 / DSH plugin for controlling mobile devices"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"通过 **WebDriverAgent（WDA）** 驱动 iOS 模拟器：截图、点击、找元素、打开 URL、抓可访问性树。\nWDA 是跑在模拟器**内部**的 XCUITest 运行器，暴露 `lo"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"calhost:8100` HTTP 服务——**零 macOS 辅助功能授权、不依赖 idb、能点任意 app（含系统弹窗）**。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Drives the iOS simulator through **WebDriverAgent (WDA)**: screenshots, taps, element lookup, URL op"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ening, accessibility-tree dumps. WDA is an in-simulator XCUITest runner exposing an HTTP API on `loc"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"alhost:8100` — no macOS accessibility permission, no idb, and it can tap any app, including system d"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"8100` — no macOS accessibility permission, no idb, and it can tap any app, including system dialogs."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 为什么用 WDA（而不是别的）"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| 方案 | 问题 |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| idb (Meta) | homebrew-core 的 `idb-companion` formula 已下架，装不上 |\n| cliclick / AppleScript | 走 macOS "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"CGEvent，需要给终端授「辅助功能」权限，否则点了没反应 |\n| **WDA ✅** | 模拟器内部 XCTest 自动化特权点击，不走 CGEvent，任何 app 都能点 |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 快速开始 Quick start"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"前置：**完整版 Xcode**（XCUITest 靠 `testmanagerd` 拉起，纯 `simctl launch` 起不来 HTTP 服务）。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"幂等设计：已在跑 → 秒返回；有缓存 → 免编译 ~30s；没缓存 → 首次 clone+编译一次（之后一直免编译）。**端口自适应**：WDA 构建产物的监听端口是编译时写死的（可能是 8100 或"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" 8101 等），脚本从运行日志发现真实端口并写入 `~/.cache/webdriveragent/wda.port`，插件和脚本都读它。模拟器包未签名、arch=arm64+x86_64，**可跨"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" Mac 复用**：把 `Build/Products` + `.xctestrun` 拷给别人，直接 `test-without-building`，谁都不用再编。真机不能这么白嫖（真机 WDA 必"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"须用含设备 UDID 的描述文件重新签名）。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 操控 API"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"见 docs/wda-drive.md：建会话、找元素、点击、坐标点击、可访问性树、截图、隐私预授权、scheme 打开 URL——全部 curl 可调。"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## DSH 工具 Tools"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"安装插件后，以下 `mobile_*` 工具自动注册进 agent 的工具集："},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 工具 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `mobile_status` | 检查 WDA 是否在服务（端口自适应，默认 8100） |\n| `mobile_wda_up` | 幂等启动 WDA（首次 clone+编译，之后免编译 ~30"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"s） |\n| `mobile_screenshot` | `simctl` 截图到 PNG |\n| `mobile_find_element` | 按 accessibility label / cl"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ass 找 UI 元素（返回元素 id） |\n| `mobile_tap` | 点元素（`elementId`）或按逻辑点坐标（`x`/`y`）点击 |\n| `mobile_accessibility"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"_tree` | 导出当前前台 app 的可访问性树 XML |\n| `mobile_open_url` | `simctl openurl` 打开 URL 或自定义 scheme 深链 |\n| `m"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"obile_grant_privacy` | `simctl privacy grant` 预授权，避免系统弹窗挡自动化 |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 路线图 Roadmap"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- [x] WDA 幂等启动（`scripts/wda-up.sh`）\n- [x] 建会话 / 找元素 / 点击 / 坐标点击 / 可访问性树\n- [x] `simctl` 截图 + privacy "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"预授权\n- [x] 自定义 scheme 打开 URL（deeplink）\n- [x] 封装为 DSH 工具（8 个 `mobile_*` tools）\n- [ ] Android（ADB）支持\n- "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"[ ] 元素级滑动 / 长按 / 输入文本"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 安装 Install"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 许可证 License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
